# ============================================================
#  ISUP shlyuzi — terminallar ro'yxati (docs/ISUP-RUNBOOK.md, 2-bo'lim)
#
#  Nusxa: cp .env.isup.example .env.isup && chmod 600 .env.isup
#  ⚠️ .env.isup git'ga TUSHMAYDI: unda terminal kalitlari va qurilma
#  tokenlari bor. Ro'yxatda yo'q terminal ulanishda RAD etiladi.
#
#  Har terminal — uch qator, indeks 0 dan ketma-ket:
#    DeviceId — terminaldagi «Device ID» (1–32: harf, raqam, - _)
#    Key      — terminaldagi «Encryption key» (8–16 belgi)
#    Token    — Bonvi qurilma kartasidagi token
# ============================================================

# Isup__Devices__0__DeviceId=ofis-kirish
# Isup__Devices__0__Key=
# Isup__Devices__0__Token=

# Isup__Devices__1__DeviceId=zavod-1
# Isup__Devices__1__Key=
# Isup__Devices__1__Token=
